OL,3,GNEWSA'Beautiful' new park opens on
OL,4,Aformer derelict site
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor decades it was a derelict corner of
OL,7,FManchester but now a "beautiful green
OL,8,Fspace" has been created as the city's
OL,9,Fnewest park.
OL,11,FCalled St Catherine's Wood, the Red
OL,12,FBank bank area in the north of the city
OL,13,Fhas been transformed in the latest
OL,14,Fphase in the development of Victoria
OL,15,FNorth, one of the largest urban
OL,16,Fregeneration projects in the region.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
