SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1787754371
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Beautiful' new park opens on
OL,4,Aformer derelict site
OL,5,
OL,6,FLandscape architect Georgina Baines
OL,7,Ffrom Planit, which designed the park,
OL,8,Fsaid: "It's about being able to take a
OL,9,Fstep away from your busy life, to come
OL,10,Finto a beautiful green space like this,
OL,11,Fto really get back in touch with
OL,12,Fnature.
OL,14,F"There are lots of spaces for you to
OL,15,Fstop, to sit, to dwell, to take in
OL,16,Fnature, because this is nature on your
OL,17,Fdoorstep."
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
